      "parameters": {
        "sendTo": "={{ $('Generate credentials').first().json.email }}",
        "subject": "Application Approved!",
        "message": "=<div style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;max-width:620px;margin:auto;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden\">   <div style=\"background:#16a34a;color:#fff;padding:22px;text-align:center\">     <h2 style=\"margin:0\">Congratulations! 🎉</h2>     <div>Your admission has been approved</div>   </div>   <div style=\"padding:24px;color:#111827;line-height:1.6\">     <p>Dear {{ $('Generate credentials').first().json['name '] }},</p>     <p>We are happy to welcome you to <b>{{ $('Generate credentials').first().json.admission_track }}</b>        ({{ $('Generate credentials').first().json.target_university }}, Batch {{ $('Generate credentials').first().json.batch_number }}).</p>      <h3 style=\"margin-bottom:6px\">Your portal login</h3>     <table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;background:#f9fafb;border:1px solid #e5e7eb\">       <tr><td style=\"padding:10px\"><b>Portal</b></td><td style=\"padding:10px\"><a href=\"https://portal.physikomatics.com/login\">https://portal.physikomatics.com</a></td></tr>       <tr><td style=\"padding:10px\"><b>Username</b></td><td style=\"padding:10px\">{{ $('Generate credentials').first().json.portal_username }}</td></tr>       <tr><td style=\"padding:10px\"><b>Temporary password</b></td><td style=\"padding:10px\"><code style=\"font-size:15px\">{{ $('Generate credentials').first().json.temp_password }}</code></td></tr>     </table>     <p style=\"font-size:13px;color:#b45309\">⚠️ Please change your password after your first login and don't share it with anyone.</p>      <div style=\"text-align:center;margin:24px 0\">       <a href=\"{{ $('Generate credentials').first().json.whatsapp_link }}\" style=\"background:#25d366;color:#fff;padding:14px 28px;text-decoration:none;border-radius:6px;font-weight:bold;display:inline-block\">💬 Join your WhatsApp Group</a>     </div>      <h3 style=\"margin-bottom:6px\">Getting started</h3>     <ol style=\"padding-left:20px\">       <li><b>Join the WhatsApp group</b> using the button above. All announcements and class links are shared there.</li>       <li><b>Log in to the portal</b> with the details above and change your password.</li>       <li><b>Complete your profile</b> and check that your name, track and batch are correct.</li>       <li><b>Check your schedule</b> in the portal for class timings and upcoming sessions.</li>       <li><b>Need help?</b> Message us on WhatsApp at +92-XXX-XXXXXXX or email support@clientdomain.com.</li>     </ol>      <p>We look forward to seeing you in class.</p>     <p>Regards,<br><b>Admissions Team</b><br> Physikomatics</p>   </div> </div>",
